/*
 * Implements helper routines for constructing synthetic variable expressions
 * and generating variable-related error messages.
 *
 * This module provides:
 *   - creation of PathExpr chains from filesystem-like paths,
 *   - construction of VarExpr nodes for core symbols,
 *   - and standardized error builders for undefined local/global variables.
 *
 * These utilities are used throughout semantic validation when the compiler
 * needs to synthesize variable references or report access errors.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::variable::create
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/variable/create.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-26
 * @Copyright (C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
